hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1507","Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawraqi told us, Abu Muawiyah told us, Al-A’mash told us. H, Harun bin Ishaq narrated to us, Ibn Fudayl narrated to us, on the authority of Al-Amash, on the authority of Ismail bin Raja’. H Muhammad bin Abdul-Ala al-San’ani told us, Yazid, meaning Ibn Zurayi, told us, Shu’bah told us, Ismail bin Raja’ told us. H, Ya’qub bin Ibrahim told us, Ibn Ulayya told us, Shu’bah told us, Ismail bin Raja’ told us. H Abu Uthman and Salam bin Junada told us, saying: Waki` told us, Abu Uthman said: Fitr bin Khalifa told us, and Salam said: on the authority of Fitr, on the authority of Ismail bin Raja, on the authority of Aws bin Damaj, on the authority of Abu Masoud, who said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “He leads The people I am most familiar with the Book of God, and if they are equal in reading, then I am the most knowledgeable of them in the Sunnah, and if they are equal in the Sunnah, then I am the most knowledgeable of them in the Sunnah. Migration, and if they were the same in the migration, then the oldest of them in age.” This is the hadith of Abu Muawiyah. And in the hadith of Shu’bah: “I make them read the Book of God, and I read them the earliest,” not in his hadith: “I teach them the most knowledgeable of the Sunnah.”"
"1508","Bundar told us, Yahya bin Sa’id told us, Shu’bah told us, Qatada told us, and Bundar told us, Yahya bin Sa’id told us, on the authority of Saeed bin Abi Orouba, and Hisham, and Bundar told us, Ibn Abi Adi told us, on the authority of Saeed, and Hisham, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Abi Nadhrah, on the authority of Abu Sa`id al-Khudri, on the authority of the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, who said: “If there are three of them, let one of them lead them, and the most worthy of them.” “I will make them most worthy of Imamate.” Narrated to us Muhammad bin Yahya, narrated to us Abd al-Ghaffar bin Ubaidullah, Shu’bah narrated to us, with this chain of narration similar to it."
